    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542600/extras/201c30344f33a0f157272e4ab518ceb8.avif?t=1746444867\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Rodobus Simulator is a simulation game that puts you in the role of a bus driver. Transport passengers, follow routes, and face challenges like traffic, weather changes, and tight schedules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude8c <strong>Realistic Driving</strong> \u2013 Well-tuned physics and authentic bus behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Detailed World</strong> \u2013 Cities realistically represented, with highways and rural roads at real scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Day and Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 The environment changes according to the time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather</strong> \u2013 Rain, fog, and other effects that impact driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea6 <strong>Varied Traffic</strong> \u2013 Local vehicles represented faithfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Career Mode</strong> \u2013 Complete routes and progress as a bus driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on the bus, follow your route, and enjoy the road! \ud83d\ude8d</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542600/extras/201c30344f33a0f157272e4ab518ceb8.avif?t=1746444867\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Rodobus Simulator is a simulation game that puts you in the role of a bus driver. Transport passengers, follow routes, and face challenges like traffic, weather changes, and tight schedules.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude8c <strong>Realistic Driving</strong> \u2013 Well-tuned physics and authentic bus behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Detailed World</strong> \u2013 Cities realistically represented, with highways and rural roads at real scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Day and Night Cycle</strong> \u2013 The environment changes according to the time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Weather</strong> \u2013 Rain, fog, and other effects that impact driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea6 <strong>Varied Traffic</strong> \u2013 Local vehicles represented faithfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Career Mode</strong> \u2013 Complete routes and progress as a bus driver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on the bus, follow your route, and enjoy the road! \ud83d\ude8d</p>",
